# Normalise to LF in the repository. This codebase has a documented history of
# encoding damage on Windows (see Family-Website/docs/decisions.md: PowerShell
# 5.1 Get-Content without -Encoding reads UTF-8 as ANSI and silently corrupts
# em dashes and curly quotes). The prose here is full of both.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
